(4,'BORDERLINE',[I],'theory','Returning boomerang through gyroscopic and aerodynamic torques','Gyroscopic turning is ordinary rigid-body mechanics, but the simplified trajectory alone does not specify blade lift or its dependence on rotation/throw parameters. Aerodynamic model sufficiency is uncertain; neither a lift law nor a worked solution is supplied.'),
